<phrase>
    <source>By default, the following variables are available: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{author}: author of the sheet&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{date}: sheet date&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{title}: sheet title&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{filename}: filename of file&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;%{plant}: name of the installation (=) in which the sheet is located&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{locmach}: name of the location (+) where the sheet is located&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{indexrev}: sheet revision index&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{version}: version number&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio}: sheet number&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio-id}: position of sheet in the project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio-total }: total number of sheets in the project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{previous-folio-num}: number of the previous sheet&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{next-folio-num}: number of the next sheet&lt; / li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projecttitle}: title of the project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projectpath}: path of the project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projectfilename}: filename of the projectfile&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li &gt;%{saveddate}: date of saving the file in local format&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{saveddate-eu}: date of saving the file in format DD-MM-YYYY&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;%{ saveddate-us}: date of saving the file in format YYYY-MM-DD&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedtime}: time of saving the file&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedfilename}: name of the file saved&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedfilepath}: path of the saved file&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</source>
    <target>Per impostazione predefinita, sono disponibili le seguenti variabili :&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{author} : autore del foglio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{date} : data del foglio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{title} : titolo del foglio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{filename} : nome del file del progetto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{plant} : nome dell&apos;installazione (=) in cui si trova il foglio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{locmach} : nome della localizzazione (+) in cui si trova il foglio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{indexrev} : indice di revisione del foglio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{version} : versione del software&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio} : numero del foglio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio-id} : posizione del foglio nel progetto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio-total} : numero totale di fogli nel progetto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{previous-folio-num} : numero del foglio precedente&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{next-folio-num} : numero del foglio successivo&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projecttitle} : titolo del progetto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projectpath} : percorso del progetto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projectfilename} : nome del file&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{saveddate} : data di salvataggio del file formato locale&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{saveddate-eu} : data di salvataggio del file formato dd-MM-yyyy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{saveddate-us} : data di salvataggio del file formato yyyy-MM-dd&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedtime} : ora di salvataggio del file&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedfilename} : nome del file salvato&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedfilepath} : percorso del file salvato&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</target>
</phrase>
